model/modeling_qwen2_5_omni.py subclasses Qwen2.5-Omni from Hugging Face
Transformers (the Qwen team, Alibaba Group, and Hugging Face contributors;
Apache-2.0). No Transformers source is copied. Pretrained model weights retain
their upstream license.

Object masks are computed with Ultralytics YOLO (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics),
AGPL-3.0, installed separately as a runtime dependency and not included here.

json/worldsense.json contains WorldSense annotations
(https://github.com/JaaackHongggg/WorldSense) in conversation format with
sample IDs and relative media paths.

json/dailyomni.json contains converted Daily-Omni annotations by Ziwei Zhou,
Rui Wang, Zuxuan Wu, and Yu-Gang Jiang. Changes: conversation-format conversion,
sample IDs, and relative media paths.
Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/liarliar/Daily-Omni
License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

calibration/3b and calibration/7b contain projections and embedding means
computed from VGGSound clips (https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vgg/data/vggsound/).
No video/audio media are included.

Dataset annotations and media remain subject to their original terms.
